        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "back, will be laid off. For purpose of the determination of recall rights under the Contract, the effective date of said layoff shall be the date he or she would have been laid off had he or she remained on the Installation Area active roll. In addition the calculation of the Employee's term of employment for layoff allowance eligibility shall be computed as the difference between the Employee's Benefit Service Date and the effective date the Employee would have actually been laid off had he or she remained on the Installation Area active roll.",
            "block_bbox": [
